            <profile id="7d17-fcb0-fa81-3c03" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="da79-edc9-ea11-dbc4" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, full plate armour, lance, and warhorse. May have cloth barding (+4 pts) or plate barding (+6 pts). The Swiss themselves have no Characters; if one or more units of Allied Men-at-Arms are purchased, they may select an Allied Duke. The Duke's Leadership can only apply to any Allied Men-at-Arms units that he chooses to join. 0-1. (Armies of Chivalry p.57)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
